{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：19:16 2026-10-16 HKT</p>\n<p>Jisoo@BLACKPINK襲港！今日（10月16日）代言人Jisoo、奚夢瑤、名模Stella Maxwell出席尖沙咀運動服裝旗艦店開幕活動，吸引了數以千計粉絲聚集海旁等候Jisoo。有企最前排粉絲透露，活動前一晚開始守候，也有人於活動當天早上9時等候。</p>\n<h2>Jisoo親切同粉絲揮手</h2>\n<p>約黃昏6時，穿着一身運動服小短裙，大騷長腿的Jisoo從座駕下車再步入會場，隨即引來粉絲們尖叫起哄。之後Jisoo到品牌佈景板前，擺出多個pose拍攝硬照，期間她的秀髪被海風吹亂，立即有工作人員上前為她整理。拍攝完畢後，Jisoo笑容滿臉的走上前，同粉絲揮手打招呼，相當親切。約兩分鐘後，Jisoo就回到店內。</p>\n<img alt=\"Jisoo@BLACKPINK襲港。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f520d7ff64c354fdb805604f3f9a4e53/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_26_55_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jisoo出席尖沙咀運動服裝旗艦店開幕活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7a676147e72e732e1a8a57614125a8f9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_26_55.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jisoo現身尖沙咀代言活動，僅逗留兩分鐘。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6da4ebb8cb97b51afb1e350b36d89ee/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_26_56.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jisoo露嫩腿抵尖沙咀代言活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8733e2ff1ba7958d0db141a13c2c82c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_26_57_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jisoo人氣高。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb76fd27fe9cb307a339fea173393dc1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_26_57.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jisoo笑容甜美。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/98518b96899b7f5230e4a074b4e8aa86/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_26_58.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jisoo到品牌佈景板前，擺出多個pose拍攝硬照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d126ccb2afc9a0535a89ad6110c8d44c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_27_00_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"開始大風……\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a0c581d952e872372c8703b5049417bf/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_27_00.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大騷長腿的Jisoo，引來粉絲們尖叫起哄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a842b30017222ce690ad3a02c0f1cbc7/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_27_01.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"數以千計粉絲聚集海旁等候Jisoo。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3cb60b3b942d675583619125abbe4d57/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_27_02_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jisoo遭怪風吹亂秀髮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50e62bd49310cea979391d17a69241e6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_31_11_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"工作人員如臨大敵，即上前整理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ab5d7fe52efb0a5789b736a1c277c4f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_31_11_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有人於活動當天早上9時等候。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1eb95f30069628c25963cba74afb207/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_26_34_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"企最前排粉絲透露，活動前一晚開始守候。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b5de80893a3d2cb3c8abe3099406464/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_26_34_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"名模Stella Maxwell出席尖沙咀運動服裝旗艦店開幕活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1597318838106535166fc3dfe9131e32/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_26_35.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Stella Maxwell\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cad23811ba529b9bfe2b4c8b95f0df96/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_26_36_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"奚夢瑤出席尖沙咀運動服裝旗艦店開幕活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/224d0f1b8d357d869f30a823759ef8c6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_26_36_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"奚夢瑤超級瘦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5ff8213a3482f23445a8b65e6b09f68/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_18_26_42.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T11:39:59.051465+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":18,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T11:16:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T19:18:05.061584+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T11:37:41.630731+00:00","content_hash":"a0ac554175d68b40522452ce0108a98dd7a3f93d324363f7089b53150dcb425c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_captur